== SEM-016 verdict faces (real machine)
1. Missing-table behavior: probe resolved 13/15 (t_account, tbl_GhostEntity silently excluded --
  information_schema miss = continue, playerDataCloneMysql.ts probePhysicalTables); the plan has 13
  queries and NO query references an absent table; plan.missing=[] (exclusion happens at probe, the
  planner never sees absent names); NO error and no "table not found" message anywhere in the chain.
  => kode cannot be the origin of a "找不到 t_account" error: the name is filtered before any SQL
  is planned, and the engine's own account table is kbe_accountinfos (KBE_TABLE_PERFIX "kbe",
  entity_table.h:37; kode entity prefix DB_TABLE_PREFIX tbl_).
2. t_account reality: SHOW-like over information_schema returns tbl_Account, tbl_Account_avatars,
  kbe_accountinfos -- no t_account. Repo-wide literal check (src+crates, TS+Rust): 0 hits
  (re-verified 2026-11-28; the 2026-11-18 code-face conclusion stands on the machine).
3. Remaining SEM-016 suspects (user-side origin: MySQL error text relayed / historical table in the
  user's own DB / another tool) -- still awaiting the user's exact error text; this acceptance proves
  the kode side silent-exclude behavior live.

